OL,3,GNEWSAAir traffic control issue causes
OL,4,AUK flight disruption for second time
OL,5,Athis month
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights across the UK - particularly
OL,8,FScotland, Northern Ireland and the
OL,9,Fnorth of England - are being disrupted
OL,10,Fby a "technical issue" with air traffic
OL,11,Fcontrol - here are the airports
OL,12,Faffected
OL,14,FNats, which runs air traffic control,
OL,15,Fsays the issue at the Prestwick centre
OL,16,Fin Ayrshire is "now fixed", and it's
OL,17,Fworking to "safely lift air traffic
OL,18,Fregulations as quickly as we can"
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
